msgstr "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Import an OpenQASM 2 program into Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Mag-import ng OpenQASM 2 program sa Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two functions import OpenQASM 2 programs into Qiskit.\n"
"These are [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), which takes a filename, and [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), which takes the OpenQASM 2 program as a string.\n"
msgstr ""
"May dalawang function na nag-iimport ng mga OpenQASM 2 program sa Qiskit.\n"
"Ang mga ito ay [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), na tumatanggap ng filename, at [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), na tumatanggap ng OpenQASM 2 program bilang string.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) para sa karagdagang "
"impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import simple programs {#import-simple-programs}"
msgstr "Mag-import ng simpleng mga program {#import-simple-programs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For most OpenQASM 2 programs, you can simply use `qasm2.load` and "
"`qasm2.loads` with a single argument.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa karamihan ng mga OpenQASM 2 program, maaari mo lang gamitin ang "
"`qasm2.load` at `qasm2.loads` na may isang argument.\n"

