"- Learn how to generate OpenQASM code in the [IBM Quantum Composer](/guides/composer) guide.\n"
"- See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) reference.\n"
"- Review the [Verify your program](/guides/debugging-tools) topic.\n"
"- Visit the [OpenQASM Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"    - Alamin kung paano gumawa ng OpenQASM code sa gabay na [IBM Quantum Composer](/guides/composer).\n"
"    - Tingnan ang sanggunian ng [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2).\n"
"    - Suriin ang paksa na [I-verify ang iyong program](/guides/debugging-tools).\n"
"    - Bisitahin ang [OpenQASM Live Specification](https://openqasm.com/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
